=== Cenario A: falha parcial (finance ok, workflow levanta RuntimeError apos gravar processo) ===
[dispatch com falha parcial] POST /api/v1/integration/outbox/dispatch -> 200 {} {"processed": 0, "failed": 1}
  <apos falha parcial> invoices=1 processes=1 tasks=1 inbox=['finance'] outbox=[('ContractActivated.v1', 'PENDING', 1, 'falha simulada apos efeito parcial do workflow')]
[dispatch apos corrigir] POST /api/v1/integration/outbox/dispatch -> 200 {} {"processed": 1, "failed": 0}
  <apos correcao> invoices=1 processes=1 tasks=1 inbox=['finance', 'workflow-preparacao-retirada'] outbox=[('ContractActivated.v1', 'PUBLISHED', 1, '')]
